---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import TimeLine from "../components/cv/TimeLine.astro";
---

<BaseLayout sideBarActiveItemID="journey" title="Journey | Agueda Schwartz">
  <div class="pb-8 mt-5">
    <div class="text-lg opacity-75">
      14+ years building products at the intersection of education and technology.
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="mb-10">
    <div class="text-3xl w-full font-bold mb-5">Experience</div>

    <TimeLine
      title="Product Manager, WGU Labs"
      subtitle="Sep 2022 to Present | Remote"
    >
      Leading 0-to-1 innovation pilots. Designed and led strategic research for an AI-powered entrepreneurship platform (50+ sources, 200+ survey responses). Built an AI-augmented PM operating system with Claude Code. Facilitated cross-functional AI upskilling workshop. Previously held Lead and Senior Learning Experience Designer roles at WGU Labs (2021 to 2022).
    </TimeLine>

    <TimeLine
      title="Learning and Development Specialist, Berdon LLP"
      subtitle="Jun 2020 to Jun 2021 | New York, NY"
    >
      Onboarded 90+ professionals into LinkedIn Learning. Built relationships with SMEs to streamline delivery of 200+ courses. Combined data sources into a compliance tracking dashboard. Influenced leadership to adopt Human Centered Design framework. Created a community of 40+ women focused on career advancement.
    </TimeLine>

    <TimeLine
      title="Product Owner, Innova Schools"
      subtitle="Nov 2017 to Jul 2018 | Lima, Peru"
    >
      Onboarded 2,000 teachers to a new learning assessment platform. Issued 30,000 report cards with 30% fewer errors. Rolled out feature reducing teacher planning time by 10%.
    </TimeLine>

    <TimeLine
      title="Monitoring and Evaluation Manager, Innova Schools"
      subtitle="Mar 2014 to Oct 2017 | Lima, Peru"
    >
      Evaluated 4 blended learning platforms across 20+ schools, 12 grades, and multiple cities. Built the program evaluation methodology for the entire school network. Coordinated quality evaluation initiative across 4 core subject areas.
    </TimeLine>

    <TimeLine
      title="Research Assistant, Pontificia Universidad Católica del Perú"
      subtitle="Jul 2010 to Feb 2014 | Lima, Peru"
    >
      Conducted research on educational technology and digital learning resources. Presented findings at LACLO 2012 conference in Guayaquil, Ecuador.
    </TimeLine>
  </div>

  <div class="mb-10">
    <div class="text-3xl w-full font-bold mb-5">Education</div>

    <TimeLine
      title="MA, Digital Media Design for Learning"
      subtitle="New York University | 2018 to 2020"
    >
      Designing technology-enhanced learning experiences at the intersection of digital media, instructional design, and learning science.
    </TimeLine>

    <TimeLine
      title="BA, Educational Psychology"
      subtitle="Pontificia Universidad Católica del Perú | 2005 to 2012"
    >
      Learning theory, cognitive science, and research methodology: the foundation for everything I build.
    </TimeLine>
  </div>

  <div class="mb-10">
    <div class="text-3xl w-full font-bold mb-5">Certifications</div>

    <TimeLine
      title="Designing Strategy"
      subtitle="IDEO U | 2024"
    >
    </TimeLine>

    <TimeLine
      title="Designing a Business"
      subtitle="IDEO U | 2023"
    >
    </TimeLine>
  </div>

</BaseLayout>
